Cc:     ~postmarketos/upstreaming@lists.sr.ht, phone-devel@vger.kernel.org,
        netdev@vger.kernel.org, devicetree@vger.kernel.org,
        linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, linux-bluetooth@vger.kernel.org,
